#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:1
#: 9a0a9eec0efb4e9ab6810344f46f40ce
msgid "Gettext AI Translation Benchmark and Tool Evaluation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:3
#: 7be7c314df964930a2873adc9a5e6ff8
msgid ""
"This guide documents the comparative benchmark and architectural "
"evaluation of open-source Python GNU gettext (`.po`) AI translation tools"
" and Large Language Model (LLM) backends for `findfmt` (Issue "
"[#303](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/303))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:8
#: 3a32d23c34e4475fa771651cc6ed10c4
msgid ""
"All benchmark metrics in this report are deterministically reproducible "
"offline using `uv run python tools/i18n_benchmark.py`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:14
#: 4540e7f6f8b34fc88a38a4ebac40577c
msgid "1. Executive Summary and Primary Recommendation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:16
#: ed814445e11a44e4945986b119bf9938
msgid ""
"As `findfmt` scales localization from the Tier 0 baseline locales (`en`, "
"`de`, `es`, `fr`, `ja`) to 52 tracked global locales under Epic "
"[#308](https://github.com/bdperkin/findfmt/issues/308), manual "
"translation of Portable Object (`.po`) catalogs becomes a maintenance "
"bottleneck."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:20
#: e0b44f7670b4458b9951375583c82993
msgid "1.1. Primary Recommendation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:22
#: bee3f07f2d7f49bea121203778fa09a9
msgid ""
"Adopt the **native `findfmt` masked-LLM translation pipeline (`findfmt-"
"masked-llm`)** inside `tools/i18n.py` (backed by "
"`tools/i18n_validation.py`), combining the best architectural patterns "
"from `gettext-translator` (deduplicated batching, missing-string "
"filtering, and model attribution comments) with `findfmt`'s existing "
"invariant placeholder masking (`__PH_N__`) and relative location "
"sanitization (`_sanitize_po_locations()`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:28
#: dbbbaa47d6e844e0bbfa3d368bd7712c
msgid ""
"**Primary Tool Architecture**: Native `tools/i18n.py translate` "
"subcommand using `mask_placeholders()`, `unmask_placeholders()`, and "
"`validate_message_pair()` from `tools/i18n_validation.py` with zero "
"mandatory runtime dependencies in `pyproject.toml`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:31
#: a41e82c0c9844fee8b4089559db3b477
msgid ""
"**Primary Cloud LLM Backend**: `OpenAI GPT-4o-mini` (or `Anthropic Claude"
" 3.5 Haiku` as secondary cloud fallback), which translates a full "
"147-entry catalog in **~8.4 seconds** for **$0.00487 per locale** "
"(**$0.2533** for all 52 tracked Tier 0–2 locales) with 100% placeholder "
"and Rich markup preservation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:35
#: 8b951f5a85a54f08b91cf0e05ea4fe50
msgid ""
"**Primary Local Offline Backend**: `Ollama` / `vLLM` serving `Qwen2.5"
"-14B-Instruct` via the same OpenAI-compatible `/v1/chat/completions` JSON"
" endpoint for zero-cost, air-gapped developer workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:41
#: 604908f891e64d7888e11cf2fdcaa80e
msgid "2. Candidate Open-Source Tool Comparison"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:43
#: d13182255add4c7f875885e4211f63d5
msgid ""
"Four open-source Python gettext translation approaches were benchmarked "
"against `findfmt`'s catalog requirements:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:46
#: c6831495d3da43dcb81fa1b586de07f8
msgid ""
"**`findfmt-masked-llm` (`tools/i18n.py` + `tools/i18n_validation.py`)**: "
"Direct batched JSON translation pipeline integrating "
"`mask_placeholders()` (`__PH_N__`), `unmask_placeholders()`, "
"`validate_po_file()`, and `_sanitize_po_locations()` over "
"OpenAI/Anthropic/Ollama/LiteLLM endpoints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:50
#: 49822bedd0b1470290eafb132d784ca2
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"**[`gettext-translator`](https://github.com/rgglez/gettext-translator)**:"
" Plugin-based Python CLI supporting OpenAI, Azure AI Translator, Gemini, "
"Ollama, NLLB, and MarianMT. Deduplicates strings, handles `msgctxt` and "
"`msgid_plural`, validates standard `{brace}` / `%s` placeholders, and "
"writes model attribution comments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:54
#: 663f1550f3614c33baed65ebb0a7189a
msgid ""
"**[`pytlai`](https://github.com/ZaguanLabs/pytlai)**: Dual CLI and Python"
" library primarily designed for AST-based inline Python docstring/comment"
" and HTML translation with OpenAI and secondary gettext `.po` export."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:57
#: 8feca8fae72c482b8d42af46395a4213
msgid ""
"**[`auto-gettext-translator`](https://github.com/javadsalman/auto-"
"gettext-translator)**: Directory-scanning batch processor using Google "
"Translate neural machine translation (NMT) while preserving `#, fuzzy` "
"flags and `.po` headers."
msgstr ""

