#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:127
#: b577cff462944fbc8c56415bfad77b17
msgid "3.3. Concrete Placeholder Corruption Examples Prevented by Masking"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:129
#: 21b0eaa6255d4159b7118c1b03af974d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**German (`de`)**: Unmasked NMT translates `{path}` to `{pfad}` and "
"capitalizes `[bold]` to `[Bold]`, raising `KeyError: 'pfad'` at runtime. "
"Masking locks `__PH_0__`, producing valid output: `Pfad '{path}' "
"existiert nicht.`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:132
#: 8111c6bfd90444eeaa1b6539ee741445
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Spanish (`es`)**: Unmasked NMT translates `{format}` to `{formato}` and"
" `[bold]` to `[negrita]`. Masking preserves `[bold]Archivo "
"coincidente:[/] [cyan]{count}[/]`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:134
#: 0be0352174374816bb4777641194b357
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**French (`fr`)**: French typographic rules insert a narrow no-break "
"space before punctuation and inside closing tags (`[/ ]`), corrupting "
"Rich markup balance. Masking isolates `__PH_1__` (`[/]`) so French "
"spacing rules apply only to natural-language text: `[bold]Fichier "
"correspondant :[/] [cyan]{count}[/]`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:138
#: cff26d16b1174056a50c99fa1ad9a790
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Japanese (`ja`)**: Unmasked NMT transliterates `{format}` to `{フォーマット}`"
" and `[cyan]` to `[シアン]`. Masking preserves `無効な形式 '{format}' です。有効な形式: "
"{valid_formats}`."
msgstr ""

